WEBVTT

00:00.780 --> 00:04.470
Hey, Akane! Did you watch
the 9 PM TV drama yesterday?

00:04.470 --> 00:06.610
I'm not into romance stuff.

00:06.610 --> 00:10.870
Oh, but it was so interesting!
I got it recorded, so let's watch it together!

00:10.870 --> 00:13.860
I don't have time to play with you.

00:14.240 --> 00:17.250
I must help out with housework and study.

00:17.250 --> 00:20.630
But you'll need a breather sometimes!

00:20.930 --> 00:22.390
Ishikura...

00:22.390 --> 00:25.460
Sorry, but I'm not interested in you.

00:25.790 --> 00:29.160
But I am! I'm interested in you!

00:29.160 --> 00:30.590
So let's be friends!

00:30.590 --> 00:31.910
Hey, now...

00:31.910 --> 00:34.010
Let's take the long way home!

00:34.010 --> 00:37.000
I found a really good
strawberry parfait store nearby!

00:37.000 --> 00:38.180
Strawberry parfait?!

00:38.180 --> 00:41.480
Oh, so you love strawberry parfaits!

00:41.480 --> 00:43.520
N-Not at all!

00:43.520 --> 00:46.820
Yeah, right!
It's all written on your face!

00:47.170 --> 00:49.950
I'll treat you to a serving today, okay!

00:53.310 --> 00:55.130
Just for a bit, then...

00:55.130 --> 00:58.340
Yay! A date with Akane!

01:03.420 --> 01:04.790
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL

01:04.790 --> 01:06.380
I HATE IN MY CLASS

01:06.380 --> 01:09.380
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

02:24.290 --> 02:29.000
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

02:29.000 --> 02:30.840
#5 I WON'T LOSE

02:30.840 --> 02:32.760
#5 I WON'T LOSE
Do you like Saito, Akane?

02:33.760 --> 02:35.890
No way in this world!

02:36.430 --> 02:38.360
Why do you ask?

02:38.860 --> 02:41.160
You see, I...

02:41.160 --> 02:44.520
I actually have a crush... on Saito.

02:44.520 --> 02:45.560
Huh?

02:46.000 --> 02:48.270
What do you like about that guy?

02:48.730 --> 02:49.650
All of him...

02:49.650 --> 02:51.260
Aren't you being deceived by him?

02:51.260 --> 02:52.840
I'm not!

02:52.840 --> 02:56.030
He's really a cool guy!

02:56.400 --> 02:58.510
When we were preparing
for the sports festival,

02:58.510 --> 03:01.540
one of our friends passed
out because of the heat...

03:02.200 --> 03:06.500
Everyone was panicking,
but only he was composed.

03:06.980 --> 03:10.750
He was looking like a cool prince then.

03:11.130 --> 03:12.750
Wasn't he just full of himself?

03:12.750 --> 03:16.760
That's what's so good about him!
Unlike other boys, he's so dependable.

03:17.070 --> 03:18.260
Well...

03:23.080 --> 03:24.770
I feel you, though.

03:25.110 --> 03:28.410
I'm not really confident about myself,

03:28.410 --> 03:32.400
so I look up to him,
who's always so confident.

03:32.700 --> 03:33.910
Look up?

03:33.910 --> 03:37.310
Also, he's surprisingly kind too!

03:37.310 --> 03:40.700
He's usually so cold,
but when I feel down, he'd notice,

03:40.700 --> 03:43.160
and ask, "You okay?" or so!

03:43.450 --> 03:46.910
So you know a lot of his good sides...

03:46.910 --> 03:47.920
Yeah!

03:48.340 --> 03:49.670
So...

03:49.670 --> 03:54.800
I see you're close to him,
so I hope you can work with me here...

03:55.110 --> 03:58.990
Please! Help me so he can
have feelings for me too!

03:59.880 --> 04:01.930
Okay, I'll help.

04:01.930 --> 04:04.980
Thanks! I love you!

04:04.980 --> 04:07.810
To be precise, what should I do?

04:08.060 --> 04:10.810
First, I'd love for you
to tell me everything about him.

04:11.190 --> 04:14.300
- I want to know everything about him!
- Come to think of it...

04:14.300 --> 04:17.140
I don't know anything about him.

04:24.580 --> 04:26.250
Wh-What are you doing?

04:26.250 --> 04:29.180
Nothing, please continue
what you're doing.

04:29.180 --> 04:31.000
I can't!

04:34.710 --> 04:36.090
LOOK OUT FOR SUSPICIOUS PERSONS

04:36.090 --> 04:38.880
My wife is stalking me...

04:38.880 --> 04:40.470
What should I do?

04:44.040 --> 04:45.790
Are you taking a video?

04:45.790 --> 04:47.480
That I am.

04:47.480 --> 04:49.170
Let's talk about my rights here.

04:49.170 --> 04:52.980
This is a home video.
No laws could interfere with this.

04:52.980 --> 04:55.570
Are you watching me?

04:55.570 --> 04:56.610
For what?

04:56.900 --> 04:59.110
Well, uh...

04:59.110 --> 05:01.990
I won't tell even if
your mouth gets torn apart!

05:01.990 --> 05:03.870
Why my mouth?!

05:03.870 --> 05:06.950
Oh, I wonder why...

05:09.450 --> 05:13.810
Um, so, what type of girl do you like?

05:13.810 --> 05:14.630
Huh?

05:15.000 --> 05:17.260
I don't have any specific preferences...

05:17.260 --> 05:19.130
So you'd sleep with any girl, then?

05:19.130 --> 05:20.510
That's too simplifying things...

05:20.810 --> 05:23.030
And what food do you like?

05:23.030 --> 05:25.250
Steaks or sushi.

05:25.250 --> 05:27.850
I love chirashi seafood
with lots of salted salmon roe.

05:27.850 --> 05:29.330
Wow, luxurious much?

05:29.330 --> 05:31.600
Grandpa always takes me there.

05:31.960 --> 05:34.150
What about the level of steak doneness?

05:34.150 --> 05:35.110
I prefer rare.

05:35.400 --> 05:36.970
So you prefer raw...

05:36.970 --> 05:38.110
Not raw.

05:38.570 --> 05:40.520
What about the garnish?

05:40.520 --> 05:42.150
Garlic saute,

05:42.150 --> 05:43.990
or anything not too crispy.

05:43.990 --> 05:45.870
Raw garlic...

05:45.870 --> 05:47.990
I told you, not raw...

05:48.810 --> 05:51.420
Seems like Saito prefers raw meat.

05:51.420 --> 05:53.920
Raw meat?! Now that's wild.

05:53.920 --> 05:55.710
He also likes raw garlic.

05:56.190 --> 05:59.840
I thought he was smart all around,
but he does have such side!

05:59.840 --> 06:01.130
I see...

06:01.130 --> 06:04.280
It's different from what you expected,
but why do you look so happy?

06:04.280 --> 06:07.370
I mean, I got to see a side of him
I never knew before!

06:07.370 --> 06:10.390
It feels like I've got closer to him!
I'm so happy!

06:10.680 --> 06:12.810
So that's how it works?

06:12.810 --> 06:15.470
Saito's hobbies are reading and video games.

06:15.470 --> 06:18.190
He'd also read some before bed.

06:18.190 --> 06:20.570
How do you know that?

06:21.400 --> 06:24.700
E-Err... I happened to hear him
talk about it with Shisei...

06:24.700 --> 06:28.060
Oh, wow! So what kind of games
does he play?

06:28.060 --> 06:31.470
Horror games! The stuff where you
shoot zombies and ghosts,

06:31.470 --> 06:33.560
in such a disgusting style!

06:33.560 --> 06:36.630
Talk about bad taste!
I can hear the sound from his headphones too!

06:36.630 --> 06:38.840
That's quite a graphic explanation.

06:38.840 --> 06:41.090
I'm totally against such games!

06:41.090 --> 06:44.280
Games should be educative and cuter,
and that's what he should play!

06:44.280 --> 06:46.470
That's all! That's all there is to it!

06:46.470 --> 06:49.660
Thanks! That was so helpful!

06:52.960 --> 06:57.440
I'll go make us dinner,
so you clean the bathroom.

06:57.440 --> 06:59.480
Okay. What's on the menu today?

06:59.810 --> 07:00.730
Fish.

07:00.730 --> 07:02.150
Fish...

07:02.600 --> 07:04.010
Got a problem?

07:04.010 --> 07:08.220
I don't. I'm just thinking about
when we will get steaks.

07:08.220 --> 07:10.330
I'm not making steaks.

07:10.330 --> 07:13.040
Even after asking so much about
my preferred level of doneness?!

07:13.340 --> 07:15.320
Were you hoping I'd make it?

07:15.320 --> 07:16.790
Well, duh!

07:17.100 --> 07:19.400
Oh, really...

07:19.400 --> 07:22.470
Well, I'm not against it, though.

07:22.470 --> 07:25.220
So you can be childish sometimes, huh?

07:28.480 --> 07:30.560
Very well, then.

07:30.560 --> 07:33.260
I'll... take responsibility.

07:34.620 --> 07:35.800
Responsibility...

07:37.320 --> 07:40.390
I love this time of the day.

07:40.390 --> 07:41.480
Why?

07:41.480 --> 07:45.380
It's so heartwarming,
makes me want to go home.

07:45.380 --> 07:47.570
It feels so nostalgic...

07:47.570 --> 07:52.240
Reminds me of when I was
expecting Mom's dinner as a child.

07:52.830 --> 07:56.250
I see... That's a world
that has nothing to do with me.

07:56.560 --> 07:57.520
What do you mean?

07:57.520 --> 07:58.260
Beats me.

07:58.260 --> 08:01.660
Answer me.
I'm asking you here.

08:01.660 --> 08:03.100
Are you interested in me?

08:03.100 --> 08:05.630
Not even one bit!

08:10.890 --> 08:13.970
If you ask me, this much is child's play!

08:14.380 --> 08:15.470
Eat up.

08:22.350 --> 08:23.130
Oh, shoot!

08:23.130 --> 08:24.610
Was it that bad?!

08:24.930 --> 08:28.360
No, I mean, all of it was so good!

08:28.620 --> 08:33.160
Unbelievable...
I can't believe you actually praise me...

08:34.220 --> 08:35.370
Is this a trap!

08:35.370 --> 08:38.460
It's not! It's so good,
I want you to make me this every day!

08:38.460 --> 08:41.730
What, are you asking me to marry you?

08:41.730 --> 08:43.890
No, that's not what I mean...

08:43.890 --> 08:45.500
Also, we're already married...

08:45.840 --> 08:49.630
Finally, you've acknowledged my greatness.

08:50.740 --> 08:54.890
Fine! I'll make you the most superb
dinner as much as you want!

08:55.320 --> 08:57.270
You're getting too close...

08:58.400 --> 09:00.680
If I say it from afar,

09:00.680 --> 09:04.150
you might not hear me just now...

09:04.710 --> 09:06.040
Y-Yeah.

09:07.440 --> 09:09.840
What kind of girl do you like, Saito?

09:09.840 --> 09:13.530
Someone said you don't
actually have a preference.

09:13.530 --> 09:14.160
Who?

09:14.160 --> 09:17.930
Ah, err... That's a secret!

09:17.930 --> 09:20.660
I can't afford to lose my informant, after all!

09:21.080 --> 09:25.290
I don't really get it, but I don't think
romance should be dictated by type.

09:25.290 --> 09:28.120
So, the person you like is your type?

09:28.120 --> 09:33.070
Not that. I'm saying types are just
limited patterns decided by someone.

09:33.070 --> 09:35.490
But humans are so complicated inside.

09:35.490 --> 09:39.180
If you don't truly know your target,
you can't come to love them.

09:40.850 --> 09:42.820
It's really nice...

09:42.820 --> 09:44.200
What do you mean?

09:44.200 --> 09:48.030
I mean, your opinion is so nice.

09:48.370 --> 09:52.810
People who confessed to me
don't really know about me.

09:52.810 --> 09:55.320
Makes me wonder
which part of me they like.

09:55.320 --> 09:58.040
I'd go so far as to ask
if it's my chest!

09:58.040 --> 09:59.520
It sure is tough being pretty.

09:59.520 --> 10:03.740
Wow, pretty?!
Saito, you're so bold!

10:03.740 --> 10:06.670
It's just my observation.
Are you not pretty?

10:06.670 --> 10:10.550
You're asking me?!
If I say yes, I'll be a narcissist, then!

10:10.550 --> 10:13.930
I can say for sure that I am a genius.

10:13.930 --> 10:15.550
We've got a narcissist here!

10:15.900 --> 10:17.530
We gotta go now.

10:17.530 --> 10:20.060
Oh, one more question.

10:20.420 --> 10:23.280
Saito, you don't do romance by type,

10:23.280 --> 10:27.130
but you can tell if you love them
after knowing how they are inside, right?

10:27.130 --> 10:28.570
Well, maybe...

10:29.390 --> 10:31.820
What about me, then?

10:31.820 --> 10:34.410
What does that mean...

10:34.410 --> 10:36.240
I'm only joking!

10:36.240 --> 10:38.710
Look at you, getting all red!
So cute!

10:38.710 --> 10:39.880
You...

10:39.880 --> 10:42.470
Sorry! See ya!

10:42.940 --> 10:45.580
She's even embarrassed herself...

10:45.880 --> 10:47.530
Getting horny at school?

10:47.530 --> 10:48.840
I'm not!

10:49.150 --> 10:52.720
Did you know?
I can smell a male in heat.

10:52.720 --> 10:55.400
Let's talk after you get out of there, okay?!

10:55.400 --> 10:59.600
Objection. I will permanently
reside between your legs.

10:59.600 --> 11:02.630
That's not an ideal spot for human settlement!

11:14.490 --> 11:15.990
SUPER SECRET NOTEBOOK

11:16.500 --> 11:19.000
I guess I can take a peek...

11:19.640 --> 11:20.600
Akane?

11:21.380 --> 11:23.500
You don't have to scream so much.

11:23.500 --> 11:26.750
No! You've got it wrong!
I'm not a secret agent or anything!

11:26.750 --> 11:27.700
What are you on about?

11:27.700 --> 11:30.360
Don't play dumb!
You laid this book on the desk,

11:30.360 --> 11:33.080
so you predicted that
I'd be entering this room, right?!

11:33.080 --> 11:37.380
It's not something to show anyone,
so I just wrote "super secret" and put it there.

11:37.720 --> 11:39.620
Then, you haven't noticed?

11:39.620 --> 11:40.500
What?

11:40.500 --> 11:41.590
Um...

11:42.220 --> 11:46.200
I wanted to ask recommendations
for any interesting books.

11:46.200 --> 11:48.270
Got anything in mind?

11:48.270 --> 11:52.900
Let's see... The "Human History Seen from
Rations and Weapons" should be humorous.

11:52.900 --> 11:54.110
HUMAN HISTORY SEEN FROM RATIONS AND WEAPONS
So heavy!

11:54.110 --> 11:56.280
HUMAN HISTORY SEEN FROM RATIONS AND WEAPONS
Am I supposed to read this while laughing?!

11:56.280 --> 12:00.040
It's so funny!
The foolish human history is written there!

12:00.040 --> 12:02.030
That's so condescending!

12:02.720 --> 12:06.880
I borrowed the book you told me
from the library,

12:06.880 --> 12:10.040
but I couldn't understand a single word.

12:10.040 --> 12:12.170
It's a hell of a complicated book, huh?

12:12.590 --> 12:15.050
It's definitely not something
you can read while laughing.

12:15.050 --> 12:17.610
Oh? Have you read the book?

12:17.610 --> 12:18.810
Yeah.

12:18.810 --> 12:19.870
How come?

12:19.870 --> 12:22.160
Well, uh...

12:22.850 --> 12:25.000
Sorry I couldn't be helpful.

12:25.000 --> 12:28.310
I should've asked him for an easier book.

12:28.630 --> 12:31.640
It's okay! You've been a great help!

12:31.640 --> 12:35.570
If I don't know what the book's about,
I can just ask him!

12:35.570 --> 12:36.350
Huh?

12:36.350 --> 12:38.970
I'm off, then!
Thanks for the topic!

12:42.410 --> 12:45.580
Hey, Saito! I tried to read this,
but it was so difficult...

12:51.880 --> 12:54.340
Thanks! Sorry for bothering you!

12:54.340 --> 12:57.340
I'm not bothered.
It's fun talking with you.

12:58.930 --> 13:01.530
You're making me blush...

13:01.530 --> 13:03.660
Besides, I owe you a great deal.

13:03.660 --> 13:04.470
Owe me?

13:04.920 --> 13:09.120
You always stop me and Akane bickering, right?

13:09.120 --> 13:12.980
I don't really like seeing people fight.

13:13.310 --> 13:16.630
Were you not around,
I might have been dead now.

13:16.630 --> 13:17.610
Thank you.

13:17.610 --> 13:21.490
Oh, come on!
It's not something worth a gratitude!

13:21.910 --> 13:24.760
Besides, Akane is not a bad person.

13:24.760 --> 13:28.120
It was her who told me
about your favourite book too.

13:28.120 --> 13:29.400
Why would she?

13:29.400 --> 13:31.500
Well, uh...

13:31.500 --> 13:34.500
Anyway, she really is a good girl!

13:34.920 --> 13:39.010
She once saved me
when I was bullied by everyone...

13:39.010 --> 13:40.120
You were?

13:40.120 --> 13:43.030
I wasn't really sociable then,

13:43.030 --> 13:46.390
and I stood out from the others,
so they'd pick on me.

13:46.670 --> 13:47.850
Stood out?

13:47.850 --> 13:51.880
There's a lot of people who don't
look good in blonde hair, but not you.

13:51.880 --> 13:53.020
I like that.

13:53.020 --> 13:56.020
You think so? Thanks.

13:56.410 --> 14:00.340
I bet you're not actually happy hearing
that from someone tasteless like me.

14:00.340 --> 14:03.990
Not at all.
I'm so happy you praised me.

14:04.340 --> 14:07.100
You two are really alike, huh?

14:07.100 --> 14:07.910
Nay!

14:08.330 --> 14:10.200
She also said this to me.

14:10.200 --> 14:13.570
That my hair is so beautiful.

14:13.570 --> 14:17.170
Those kids mocking you
really don't have good taste.

14:17.570 --> 14:20.000
Thanks to her,
I stopped being bullied.

14:20.000 --> 14:23.680
That's why Akane is my life saviour.

14:25.960 --> 14:28.520
Curious about him and Himari?

14:28.520 --> 14:30.320
I'm not!

14:30.320 --> 14:33.310
I was just thinking I've never
seen her looking like that!

14:33.750 --> 14:35.220
It's not the first time.

14:35.220 --> 14:39.190
Whenever Himari looks at him,
she always looks like that.

14:39.510 --> 14:42.890
She's always like that since first year.

14:42.890 --> 14:45.040
Did you not notice?

14:45.040 --> 14:46.450
N-No...

14:46.910 --> 14:49.000
Cousin and Himari are made
for each other.

14:49.000 --> 14:51.530
N-No, they're not.

14:51.530 --> 14:54.710
Such a good girl is too good for him.

14:55.060 --> 14:58.710
So you hate if they're a match?

14:59.170 --> 15:01.240
N-No...

15:02.240 --> 15:04.030
Thanks, Akane!

15:04.030 --> 15:06.580
I could chat a lot with Saito!

15:06.580 --> 15:08.720
G-Good for you...

15:09.100 --> 15:11.400
He said this blonde hair suits me!

15:11.400 --> 15:14.710
Does that mean I have a shot?
What do you think?

15:14.710 --> 15:17.860
I guess he's more into you than not.

15:17.860 --> 15:20.230
Right?! I knew it!

15:20.550 --> 15:22.060
It's all thanks to you!

15:22.060 --> 15:24.690
Oh, right!
I'll go buy a strawberry tart from Philia,

15:24.690 --> 15:27.550
so let's go have a chat
all day long at your place!

15:27.550 --> 15:31.020
Nice! I'd love to hang out with you
after some time...

15:31.820 --> 15:36.000
Um, my house is a bottomless pit now,
so I can't invite anyone over...

15:36.000 --> 15:37.500
How do you live, then?!

15:37.860 --> 15:39.320
Barrel...

15:39.320 --> 15:40.060
Barrel?

15:40.060 --> 15:43.680
I cut a barrel in half,
and live on it!

15:43.680 --> 15:45.260
Yeah, that's baloney!

15:45.260 --> 15:47.680
You don't want me in your house?

15:47.680 --> 15:51.230
Shisei bragged to me that
she once visited your place...

15:51.230 --> 15:55.740
S-Sorry, it doesn't mean that
I don't want you in my house,

15:55.740 --> 15:58.520
but it's kind of a mess now...

15:58.520 --> 16:00.520
Am I a bother?

16:00.520 --> 16:04.530
You're not!
I'll be happy if you come visit!

16:04.920 --> 16:08.030
Huh?! Himari is coming to visit us?!

16:08.030 --> 16:10.500
I couldn't turn her down at all.

16:10.500 --> 16:13.610
She was jealous of Shisei...

16:13.610 --> 16:15.700
I guess I share the responsibility.

16:15.700 --> 16:18.420
I should've sealed her mouth tighter.

16:18.420 --> 16:22.130
Anyway, I'll go clean up your belongings
so Himari doesn't find out.

16:22.130 --> 16:25.140
I'll spray some deodorant
to hide the scent too.

16:25.140 --> 16:28.450
Until Himari leaves,
you hide in your study room...

16:29.050 --> 16:31.010
UNLOCK - INTERPHONE - END

16:31.010 --> 16:33.300
I got so hyped, I came early!

16:33.300 --> 16:34.310
Is that okay?

16:34.310 --> 16:35.810
It's okay.

16:35.810 --> 16:39.130
I must remove your trace now...
Your presence too!

16:39.130 --> 16:43.410
Don't remove my presence!
I'll go clean up! You deal with her!

16:43.410 --> 16:44.680
Got it!

16:46.940 --> 16:48.170
Pardon the intrusion!

16:48.170 --> 16:48.950
Sure!

16:48.950 --> 16:50.820
Why'd she let her in already?!

16:52.690 --> 16:53.970
Come on in.

16:53.970 --> 16:56.220
Wow, so nice!

16:57.080 --> 16:59.460
SHISEI - I HEAR HUMANS
BLINK A MILLION TIMES IN A YEAR

16:59.460 --> 17:02.770
Oh? Did you hear a sound
from the kitchen just now?

17:02.770 --> 17:04.410
Really?

17:04.410 --> 17:07.000
Like a phone's notification sound.

17:07.000 --> 17:10.220
Must be your imagination!
It must come from outside!

17:11.320 --> 17:12.720
I'll ask you this, just in case.

17:13.400 --> 17:16.760
I can invite Saito on a date, right?

17:16.760 --> 17:18.410
Wh-Why ask me?

17:18.410 --> 17:23.440
I thought you were always curious
about him since first year.

17:23.440 --> 17:24.860
I'm not!

17:25.290 --> 17:29.610
If you have a crush on him,
then I won't be in the way.

17:29.960 --> 17:32.360
I love him,

17:32.360 --> 17:34.340
but I love you too.

17:35.010 --> 17:37.370
Is this really okay?

17:37.370 --> 17:39.550
Of course it is.

17:39.550 --> 17:42.080
So you don't have a crush on him?

17:42.080 --> 17:45.500
I don't! He's so snobby and insensitive!

17:45.500 --> 17:46.840
I hate him!

17:46.840 --> 17:51.540
Glad to hear that!
I was afraid of becoming your rival!

17:51.540 --> 17:53.560
No way!

17:56.840 --> 17:58.390
Will it be a bother?

17:58.760 --> 18:02.390
You don't want to
go on a date with me, right?

18:02.390 --> 18:04.820
No way I don't want to.

18:05.250 --> 18:09.110
Most boys would be delighted
if you invited them.

18:09.110 --> 18:11.610
What about you?

18:12.050 --> 18:13.860
Of course, I'll be happy to.

18:14.360 --> 18:15.720
Thank goodness...

18:17.000 --> 18:18.990
Do you want this?

18:19.630 --> 18:21.120
What do you mean?

18:21.480 --> 18:25.250
You sure you don't want to stop them?

18:25.630 --> 18:27.000
Why me?

18:27.400 --> 18:29.090
You still don't get it?

18:29.090 --> 18:32.600
All your feelings, your thoughts...

18:32.600 --> 18:35.080
You sure you want me to speak it for you?

18:35.080 --> 18:37.160
Don't say strange things to Himari!

18:37.160 --> 18:41.520
I want her to be happy!
I don't want her to be sad!

18:41.850 --> 18:43.900
Not to Himari.

18:43.900 --> 18:47.900
You sure you want me
to speak about you to you?

18:50.570 --> 18:53.630
Actually, I was invited for a date by Himari.

18:53.630 --> 18:57.240
I know. Glad someone
so pretty like her likes you.

18:57.240 --> 18:59.310
She's just too good for you.

18:59.310 --> 19:00.040
Well, yeah.

19:00.530 --> 19:04.410
So, why would you go so far
to tell me that?

19:04.760 --> 19:06.670
Can I go on the date?

19:07.080 --> 19:08.940
Why ask me?

19:08.940 --> 19:10.890
We are married,
just so you know.

19:10.890 --> 19:14.170
I'm not doing this because I like it!
I was forced to do this!

19:14.170 --> 19:17.820
We're just bound to achieve
our separate dreams!

19:17.820 --> 19:20.520
You can date anyone you want,
love anyone you want!

19:20.520 --> 19:22.680
It doesn't concern me!

19:23.080 --> 19:24.130
Okay.

19:24.630 --> 19:27.270
I just wanted to make sure, just in case.

19:31.350 --> 19:33.330
Are you really going?

19:33.330 --> 19:35.400
I'll stop if you stop me.

19:35.680 --> 19:39.530
I won't! You just have fun
with Himari on your date!

19:39.960 --> 19:41.790
I'm off, then.

19:42.190 --> 19:43.720
I'll be home late.

19:44.790 --> 19:46.940
Don't go...

19:47.850 --> 19:51.550
I don't know why I hate it,
but I can't take it.

19:51.550 --> 19:55.170
The thought of you shopping
together with another girl...

19:55.170 --> 19:57.740
Just thinking of it aches my heart...

19:57.740 --> 20:01.430
Even if it's just for show,
you're still my husband!

20:03.560 --> 20:05.430
That's what I wanted to hear.

20:06.670 --> 20:08.970
I already turned down the date.

20:08.970 --> 20:12.070
So you don't actually hate me, huh?

20:12.070 --> 20:15.320
Huh?! This is a scam!
I've been bamboozled!

20:15.320 --> 20:17.900
I really hate you so much! I hate you!

20:20.800 --> 20:24.390
We were supposed to go
shopping together today, right?

20:24.390 --> 20:26.200
We're just doing groceries.

20:26.510 --> 20:29.710
Let's take the long way there.
It's our day off, after all.

20:29.710 --> 20:30.330
But...

20:30.330 --> 20:31.210
Come on.

20:31.590 --> 20:34.250
Wait, I haven't dressed up!

20:34.250 --> 20:35.800
You're already looking pretty.

20:36.720 --> 20:40.590
You'll buy me anything
I want as an apology, okay!

20:40.890 --> 20:42.970
Got it. Want to buy rings too?

20:42.970 --> 20:44.350
Rings?!

20:44.350 --> 20:47.330
It's still too early for that!

20:50.360 --> 20:51.980
Morning, Saito!

20:52.440 --> 20:56.640
Forgive me if it's just my delusion,
but you did invite me for a date, right?

20:56.640 --> 20:57.480
Yep!

20:57.480 --> 21:00.980
And I turned you down, right?
Then why are you still speaking to me?

21:00.980 --> 21:03.490
Oh, that doesn't matter!

21:03.490 --> 21:07.040
My feelings for you
won't change even after that.

21:07.040 --> 21:09.710
I can always ask you out again
if you turn me down.

21:09.710 --> 21:11.250
Attagirl...

21:11.660 --> 21:13.860
Oh? Am I being praised?

21:13.860 --> 21:15.130
Yay!

21:15.620 --> 21:19.070
You see, when I tried to befriend Akane,

21:19.070 --> 21:20.610
I approached her many times,

21:20.610 --> 21:23.390
despite being shooed away many times,
we finally became friends.

21:23.770 --> 21:26.640
I won't give up on you either.

21:26.980 --> 21:30.390
I'll make you love me too.

21:30.390 --> 21:34.860
I won't hand him over to anyone
not approved by my standards.

21:34.860 --> 21:36.440
Who are you speaking as?

21:36.800 --> 21:39.060
I am your little sister, and father.

21:39.060 --> 21:41.700
I live in many things.

21:41.700 --> 21:45.160
What should I do to get your approval?

21:45.160 --> 21:47.530
It depends on your efforts.

21:47.530 --> 21:51.260
As proof of your loyalty,
buy me 100,000 pieces of melon bread.

21:51.260 --> 21:52.700
Don't persuade her to bribe you!

21:52.700 --> 21:53.960
Got it! I'll do my best!

21:53.960 --> 21:57.470
I'll do anything for him!

21:58.400 --> 21:59.840
I won't lose...

22:01.330 --> 22:04.970
What... am I saying?

23:34.980 --> 23:40.840
#6 FIRST DATE OF A MARRIED COUPLE
